Subject: [M156] media: Safely drain promises in CdmPromiseAdapter::Clear

Original change's description:
> media: Safely drain promises in CdmPromiseAdapter::Clear
>
> Rejecting a promise during CdmPromiseAdapter::Clear() may trigger
> client callbacks that call SavePromise(). Move promises_ to a local
> map before iterating to avoid iterator invalidation and use-after-free.
>
> Bug: 568831768
> Change-Id: If8364c9ace5d0f5eb06104b065a2187b6a6a6964
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8518406
> Reviewed-by: Ted (Chromium) Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Feras Aldahlawi <frs@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1717947}

